[ti:A baba ṛuḥ]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Au Nom de Tous Les Miens]
[length:8:01]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:43.00] Ur k-fkiɣ yelli neɣ mmi
[00:53.32] Ad ak-illin s idisan-ik
[01:09.09] Axxam-ik d lexlawi
[01:21.40] Ɣer ɣur-k
[01:24.48] Ttjur d arraw-ik
[01:35.81] Mačči d lɣeṛḍ-iw tigi
[01:40.17] Ugiɣ-tent bɣant-iyi
[01:43.90] A baba ggan-iyi
[01:54.26] Aql-iyi-n deg ubrid-ik
[02:10.43]
[02:14.03] Ula i d-am-nniɣ
[02:17.21] A weltma yif-aɣ ṛebbi
[02:21.00] Ula i d-am-ḥkiɣ
[02:24.06] S lḥif i d-nelmed tikli
[02:27.65] Di lǧeṛṛa-s ḥesb-iyi lliɣ
[02:31.37] Yeqḍeɛ-iyi-d lehlak kniɣ
[02:34.46] Ur fṛiḥeɣ ur zhiɣ
[02:38.18] Ḥader ccan ad am-iṛuḥ
[02:41.36] A baba ṛuḥ
[02:44.91] Ṛuḥ a win ḥemmeleɣ ṛuḥ
[02:56.15] Ṛuḥ a win, a win ḥemmeleɣ Ṛuḥ
[03:08.02]
[03:21.12] Ula di lemnam
[03:24.33] Anda-t win ihennan deg-neɣ
[03:27.77] Leḥzen deg uxxam
[03:31.00] Si tesga yugi ad yeffeɣ
[03:34.65] Ifettet akk wayen nessaram
[03:38.25] S ẓẓuṛ isberber-d ṭṭlam
[03:42.09] Ibubb-d leɣmam
[03:45.40] Akka a yemma i d yir ṣbuḥ
[03:48.49] A baba ṛuḥ
[03:52.08] Ṛuḥ a win ḥemmeleɣ ṛuḥ
[04:05.12] Ṛuḥ a win ḥemmeleɣ, a win ḥemmeleɣ Ṛuḥ
[04:17.38]
[04:30.32] Lḥif ɣef lḥif
[04:33.37] Yal taluft tɛeṛḍ-d weltma-s
[04:36.83] Ur d-tger asurif
[04:39.57] Talwit aɣ-d-dhen layas
[04:43.25] Seg-mi i iɣ-iseḥḥeb wassif
[04:47.13] Ur aɣ-yečči ur ɣ-yeḍliq af rrif
[04:50.94] Nezga nesḥissif
[04:54.37] Ulac tiɣmart ur aɣ-ncuḥ
[04:57.52] A baba ṛuḥ
[05:02.86] Ṛuḥ a win ḥemmeleɣ ṛuḥ
[05:15.75] Ṛuḥ a win, a win ḥemmeleɣ Ṛuḥ
[05:28.19]
[05:40.51] Ulac win i yeftin
[05:44.04] Ad as-nini ad d-yeɣṛem wayeḍ
[05:47.83] Ah ya ṛebbi aḥnin
[05:50.61] Amek akka s tiggi tɛemdeḍ
[05:54.16] Ur nejhel ur neqqaṛ amin
[05:57.76] Ur nettɛuzzu yal ddin
[06:01.58] Ad neṛǧu ar aɣ-awin
[06:04.81] Ad neḍfeṛ iɛzizen ɣef ṛṛuḥ
